\  & =\\sqrt{34}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of $△\\,ABC$ is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{\\sqrt{34}}{2}.\n$$" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350583 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350584 13194139535464 true] [17592186350583 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535464 true] [17592186350583 1041 "field-1" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350583 1104 #edb/ref 17592186350584 13194139535464 true] [17592186350583 1110 #uuid "3e19f751-c1b4-57d2-bbd0-dfd1ae8c4f82" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350584 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{34}}{2}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350584 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350584 1111 #uuid "18bd6986-6612-50cc-9393-633e1ad7b0af" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350585 1017 #edb/ref 17592186350586 13194139535464 true] [17592186350585 1089 "q-71107" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350585 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535464 true] [17592186350585 1100 "Calculate the area of the $△\\,NPQ$, if $N(1,0,1)$, $P(2,2,3)$, $Q(2,1,1).$" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350585 1113 #uuid "6d2a2f20-248d-5b98-87d8-9cde9ba325b0" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350585 1145 "First, we find the vectors $\\overset{\\to }{NP}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{NQ}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{NP} & =p-n \\\\  & =(2i+2j+3k)-(i+k) \\\\  & =i+2j+2k \\\\  & =⟨1,2,2⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{NQ} & =q-n \\\\  & =(2i+j+k)-(i+k) \\\\  & =i+j \\\\  & =⟨1,1,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the formula to compute the cross product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{NP}\\times \\overset{\\to }{NQ} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(2\\cdot 0-1\\cdot 2)i-(1\\cdot 0-1\\cdot 2)j+(1\\cdot 1-1\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =-2i+2j-k \\\\  & =⟨-2,2,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{NP}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{NQ}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\overset{\\to }{NP}\\times \\overset{\\to }{NQ}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-2)^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of $△\\,NPQ$ is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350587 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350588 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350589 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350590 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350591 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1041 "selection" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1104 #edb/ref 17592186350590 13194139535464 true] [17592186350586 1110 #uuid "d6e5aac2-ca9b-54d9-ad9e-5218bc54c3e8" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350587 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350587 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350587 1111 #uuid "6f48f53a-d894-5bbd-9f36-536d63f2f504" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350588 1034 "3" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350588 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350588 1111 #uuid "598e7301-6927-57fb-bc92-0a4083fcf305" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350589 1034 "2" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350589 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350589 1111 #uuid "d9b54c36-462c-5b60-a404-ba5758ad9cdc" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350590 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350590 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350590 1111 #uuid "70d8df7e-12a5-5b86-a882-82e39b214fb9" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350591 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350591 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 131