\nLet's also compute $WY$ since it appears in the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}WY & =|\\overset{\\to }{WY}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, using the formula ${A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}ZH\\cdot WY,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{△} & =\\frac{1}{2}ZH\\cdot WY \\\\ \\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}ZH\\cdot \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 3\\sqrt{2} & =ZH\\cdot \\sqrt{3} \\\\ ZH & =\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\ ZH & =\\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350594 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350595 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350596 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350597 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350598 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1041 "selection" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1104 #edb/ref 17592186350596 13194139535464 true] [17592186350593 1110 #uuid "50b84d81-dbab-5875-acb8-1712fa26cef0" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350594 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350594 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350594 1111 #uuid "1b256a0a-54e3-5d07-80c5-191df4988e7d" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350595 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350595 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350595 1111 #uuid "4eb47461-13a6-5780-a4bd-29971a889db0" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350596 1034 "\\sqrt{6}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350596 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350596 1111 #uuid "265b81e4-19d2-5a40-8a13-9c354b376b25" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350597 1034 "\\frac{3\\sqrt{6}}{2}" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350597 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535464 true] [17592186350597 1111 #uuid "aaaaa3dc-5197-585c-b6e8-ca4fc16a55f2" 13194139535464 true] [17592186350598 1034 "3\\s